Cell["\<\
Note that N[...] forces Mathematica to evaluate functions, rather than \
keeping them as symbolic expressions which is slower. For plotting purposes \
we also form a table of pairs of (x, y) coordinates:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.682821626014554*^9, 3.682821678687368*^9}, {
  3.6828217629521847`*^9, 3.6828217978933697`*^9}, {3.682839476782588*^9, 
