Cell["\<\
So, since now the frequencies  2\[Pi] 1.35/M  and  2\[Pi] 4.05/M  fall \
between the bin frequencies of the DFT, for each frequency we get several \
peaks. Let us now compress such a signal by keeping only 8 floating point \
largest numbers (either real or imaginary parts of the DFT of such a signal).\
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6828223357140837`*^9, 3.6828223461219473`*^9}, {
