Cell["\<\
So, since now the frequencies  2\[Pi] 3.5/M  and  2\[Pi] 7.5/M  fall between \
the bins 3 and 4 and between 7 and 8, respectively, of the DFT, for each \
frequency we get two peaks, but it appears that suddenly we also get a whole \
bunch of frequencies not present in the original signal!  As a consequence, \
this signal is not well compressible:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6828223357140837`*^9, 3.6828223461219473`*^9}, {
  3.682822433612636*^9, 3.682822694209586*^9}, {3.682822766106935*^9, 
